 📖 ABOUT THIS PROJECT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The DISM UI Control Center is a key component of the WinTwin.Fusion Framework.
It provides essential functions that enable the end user to work with Windows
image files via the Framework. All tools feature a graphical user interface
that simplifies the process of performing tasks and actions involving Windows
image files. Below is a list of the tools included in the DISM UI Control Center:

- wim.mounter:  Tool to mount *.wim-Files
- wim.unmount:  Tool to unmount *.wim-Files

